  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fcce12ca7df8a2a",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 HFlow 评估了最新的开放权重视觉语言模型（VLM）在处理第一视角数据方面的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebad8a95eeb9c2d3",
      "translationZh": "这项评估基于 Build AI 的 Egocentric-10k 评估，后者使用 Gemini 2.5 Flash 来衡量手部可见性和主动操作情况。我们保留了相同的提示词和数据集，仅更换了模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1aa5f59f4c480633",
      "translationZh": "各模型与原始结果的一致程度如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d863e8dc12c2a60b",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash：91.65%（基线）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8585b4e7acec4279",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 的表现最为突出。它的结果与 Gemini 相当，而成本低至 Gemini 的 1/19。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02776dde5d11b2a5",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 和 Qwen 模型都适合自行部署，能够在数据不外流的情况下进行私密处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b037a279b59b59aa",
      "translationZh": "这表明，现代开放权重视觉语言模型正逐渐达到足以用于大规模第一视角数据处理的水平。主要差异越来越体现在成本、吞吐量、输出可靠性以及自行部署的便捷程度上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ee5d3060e9c0ff6",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在针对第一人称视角数据优化多模态处理，可以使用 Hflow，以任意提示词和模型自行运行这项评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb448fc667933836",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/kuaythrone 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
